2 CONT
2 CONT Serena Sirie "Sarah" Peterson Bergeland
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Apr. 6, 1829, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Nov. 18, 1873
2 CONT
2 CONT Dau of Ola Jakobson & Anna Andreasdtr.Bergeland
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pedar Peterson in 1849 in Norway. Eight children were born to this union--Anna, Pedar Jr, Ole, Karina, Andreas(Andrew), Enock, Joakim(Jay) and an infant name Bergeland.
2 CONT
2 CONT When her father Ole Jakobson Bergeland died in 1865, Serena (Sirie) and her husband and two children came to America. As was the Scandinavian custom, Peter changed his last name from Peterson to Bergeland.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is believe Serena known as Sarah died from complications of child birth in 1873 at age 44.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is buried in the First Lutheran Cemetery rural Ossian.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse:
2 CONT *Peder Pederson Bergeland (1826 - 1904)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT *Ole Pederson Bergeland (1855 - 1935)*
2 CONT *Caroline Peterson Walvatne (1857 - 1926)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Calculated relationship*
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: First Lutheran Church Cemetery  Ossian Winneshiek County Iowa, USA
