3 FILE https://media.geni.com/p13/1c/7e/54/96/5344485df1cd81db/1900_norway_census_jacob_halversen_original.png?hash=cd865a4c8fc9f28fd82ded6e897fc68806c565ee0178e9bed1073cc237df9215.1796111999
3 FORM png
3 TITL 1900 Norway Census Jacob Halversen.png
3 NOTE There were many, many name variants, including the name of the farm which had various spellings:  Worre, Vorre, Vora, and Norwegian spellings. 
4 CONT
4 CONT The records and published history of Avaldsnes indicate that Jakob Halvorsen came from Finnøy district of Rogaland and was born about 1841 and died 1912. In Avaldsnes he and his family resided on the farm known as Vårå.
4 CONT Siri (Sigrid) Askildsdatter came from Suldal district of Rogaland, was born there 29 Nov 1840 and was baptised 1 Jan 1841.
4 CONT The parish records for those areas are available online for your research and the various bygdebøker for those districts will probably be of great use to you.  
4 CONT Siri (Sigrid) Askildsdatter would be the older sister of the "Askel Askelson Underbakke"
4 CONT
