2 CONT Anna Kro Oleson BIRTH	24 Nov 1847 Stavanger, Stavanger kommune, Rogaland fylke, Norway DEATH	Aug 1940 (aged 92) Madison County, Nebraska, USA BURIAL	 Hope Cemetery Platte County, Nebraska, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna is the daughter of Helge Olson and Anna Iversdtr. Her full birth name is Anna Helgesdatter Kro (Helgesdatter her patronymic name, Kro the farm she lived on). She married Oley Oleson on October 14, 1871 in Rowe Church, Rowe, L
2 CONC ivingston County, Illinois.
