2 SURN Erland
1 NAME Selvine Sally /Erland/
2 GIVN Selvine Sally
2 SURN Erland
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 5 NOV 1909
2 ADDR
3 CITY North Battleford
3 STAE Saskatchewan
3 CTRY Canada
