1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/56686282/martha_larsdatter_fjelde
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha (Marthe) Larsdatter Forland was born​ February 21, 1831 at Strand, Rogaland, Norway to Lars Povelsen and Ingeborg Tostensdatter of Torreland. She was baptized on March 3, 1831 at Strand, Norway. Birth/baptismal record found
2 CONC  at the Norwegian Digital Archives online for Strand in Strand, Rogaland, Norway, 1816-1833, page 71, entry # 6: Parents: Lars Povelsen and Ingeborg Tostensdatter of Torreland.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was confirmed at same in 1845. Confirmation record at Norwegian Digital Archives online for Strand in Strand, Rogaland, Norway 1834-1854, page 291, entry # 6.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marthe married Peder Olsen Fj​elde on March 23, 1852 at Strand, Norway. The couple had 11 children: Inger, Ole, Berthe, Edvard Jorgen, Endre, Lars, Lewis, Marte Peder, Petra Emelia, Peder.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family emigrated to Mitche​ll County, Iowa in the spring of 187​2. Emigration record leaving at Norwegian Digital Archives on line for Strand in Strand, Rogaland, Norway 1855-1881, page 350 (right side of pages), entries # 3 throu
2 CONC gh 12: Peder O Fjelde, Marthe Larsdatter, Inger, Ole, Berte, Edvard Torgrim Lauritz, Endre, Lars, Marte, Peder (born March 10, 1872).
2 CONT
2 CONT Arrived at Quebec, Canada May 21, 1872 on the ship Brodrene. (Record found on Ancestry.com): Peder Olsen Fjelde age 46, Martha Larsdatter age 38, son Ole 17, daughter Inger 19, daughter Bertha 15, son Edvard 12, son Endre 9, son L
2 CONC ars 6, daughter Martha 3, son Peder 1 month.
2 CONT
2 CONT Found Marthe in the 1880 to 1905 censuses living at Cedar, Mitchell, Iowa:
2 CONT 1880: Peter Field 57, Martha Field 50, Ole Field 25, Edward Field 19, Andrew Field 17, Lars Field 15, Martha Field 10, Emalia Field 6, Peter Field 3.
2 CONT 1885: Peter O Tjelde 60, Martha Tjelde 57, Edward Tjelde 24, Andrew Tjelde 22, Louis Tjelde 18, Martha Tjelde 16, Amelia Tjelde 11, Peter Tjelde 8.
2 CONT 1900: Peder Fjelde 75, Martha Fjelde 69, Peder Fjelde 23.
2 CONT (Censuses transcribed as found without fixing spelling errors.)
2 CONT
2 CONT After Peder's death, Marthe went to live with a daughter in North Dakota. She died on N​ovember 5th (or 15th?), 1915 at Park River, Walsh, North Dakota, after a battle with stomach cancer. She was buried at the R​ock Creek Luthera
2 CONC n Cem​etery, Meroa, Cedar, M​itchell, Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marthe and Peder's children:
2 CONT 1. Inger Pedersdatter Fjeld is at FAG #29849792.
2 CONT 2. Ole Pedersen Fjelde is at FAG # 56660804.
2 CONT 3. Berthe Pedersdatter (born April 4, 1857 Strand, Norway, married Oswald Strand December 1879 Iowa, married Edward Rolla June 1894, died November 8, 1938 Worth, Iowa, probably buried in Worth Co, IA.
2 CONT 4. Edvard Jorgen Laurits Fjelde (born December 25, 1869 Strand, Norway, died July 1, 1934 Edinburg, Walsh, North Dakota.)
2 CONT 5. Endre (Andrew) Pedersen Fjelde FAG # 56652055.
2 CONT 6. Lars Pedersen Fjelde (born Feb 5, 1865, died April 21, 1865 both at Strand, Rogaland, Norway).
2 CONT 7. Lars (Lewis) Pedersen Fjelde (born April 17, 1866 Strand, Norway, died July 3, 1946 Mason City, Cerro Gordo, Iowa, buried at Manly, Worth, Iowa).
2 CONT 8. Marte Pedersdatter (born December 1, 1868, married Aaron Levin at Park River, North Dakota, died November 15, 1941 Park River, North Dakota);
2 CONT 9. Peder Pedersen Fjelde (born March 10, 1872 Strand, Norway, died September 24, 1872 Cedar, Mitchell, Iowa, buried at RCLC Cemetery).
2 CONT 10. Petra Emelia Fjelde - FAG # 70658437
2 CONT 11. Peder Pedersen Fjelde (born September 1, 1876 Cedar, Mitchell, Iowa, died September 24, 1949 Ann Arbor Washtenaw, Michigan.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Research credit: Deidre Badker
